        <item>
            <title>2.4.21</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:04:40 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>261</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Search in Current Folder now honors Contents mode and regular expressions (it only matched names before)</li>
<li>Search by filters alone: leave the text empty and pick a size, date or kind (Spotlight when indexed)</li>
<li>Saved searches remember Names/Contents mode, regex, custom dates and the folder they searched</li>
<li>Extension filters (`ext:png`) work together with content and regex searches</li>
<li>⌘Delete moves to Trash again in the file list (Backspace's "Back" took it); Backspace, Return, Space, F2 and F5 act only without ⌘/⌥/⌃</li>
<li>⌘↑ (Enclosing Folder) goes up one level, not two</li>
<li>File ▸ Close Window (⌘⇧W) is back</li>
<li>⌘⌥2/3/4 only set the number of panes (they also meant "focus pane"); switch panes with Ctrl+Tab or a click</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.21/Hayate-2.4.21.dmg" length="12116798" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="MkMSUZAulXGeK2MFoi+oZ4n+z4br5HQjS3R+mvZWfybtDcRmh5Z9+Bhm7g4lb37gTczSayTv7np4NpLtutQnBw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.20</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:26:04 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>260</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.20</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Built-in terminal is back: View ▸ Toggle Terminal (⌃`). The menu item had been lost in an earlier update</li>
<li>The terminal is now a full terminal emulator (SwiftTerm): typing no longer duplicates characters or blanks the screen, and full-screen programs like vim, top and less work</li>
<li>`cd` in the terminal moves the file list along, and navigating in the file list changes the terminal's folder (only at the prompt — never typed into vim, ssh or another running program)</li>
<li>The terminal starts with your usual environment (SSH agent, PATH, TMPDIR …), and its shell ends when Hayate quits</li>
<li>Changes to hidden files no longer show "changed" banners or reload the list while hidden files are not shown (the terminal's history file flashed a banner after every command)</li>
<li>With several panes, clicking the terminal no longer switches to pane 1; in icon view, double-clicking below the items no longer opens the selected file</li>
<li>Help ▸ Third-Party Notices lists the open-source components Hayate includes</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.20/Hayate-2.4.20.dmg" length="12798975" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="4cUD8KHPbKdSYDzY2ECNeq4tmUnJfm8Xk/YzLzgKztTK+PcJs3X/45qLTyLub1i2QYcBkTajV+tVpVLb/ZY7CA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.19</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:49:45 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>259</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.19</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>ZIP browsing works again in list and icon view: double-clicking a .zip shows its contents (it kept showing the surrounding folder)</li>
<li>Right-click menu: items that do not apply are greyed out again (for example Rename with several files selected)</li>
<li>With more than 1,000 items selected, Share, Tags, Plugins and Put Back are disabled instead of acting on only part of the selection</li>
<li>Dropping a folder into one of its own subfolders is refused quietly instead of failing with an error</li>
<li>Fixed an inconsistent sort order for items with equal size, date, kind or permissions when sorting descending</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.19/Hayate-2.4.19.dmg" length="10168750" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="yWiroj4Cc1nsW8Wfq3KwkPEcyl8DzVqVSwjMwH5pHpOqga1AN5jYMwdaF289K3DKdgQD8TTT+9CyOLI0UJPKDQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.18</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:44:38 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>258</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.18</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Sidebar folder tree: smaller indentation, so names stay readable several levels deep</li>
<li>Hover over a folder in the sidebar tree to see its full path</li>
<li>Open With ▸ Change Default App…: choose the app that opens every file of that type (like Finder's "Change All"), including Other… to pick any app. The current default is marked in the Open With list</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.18/Hayate-2.4.18.dmg" length="10164438" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="8Lj7FfeN99RelwvtW5dWhaoy5CnUoQk4nwBqJxxURKxq2jZfVuDuVTBheZ6jLb0oRcRQVU6kHlqF0qvDKElgBQ=="/>
