        <item>
            <title>2.4.17</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:53 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>257</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Edit menu: Invert Selection (⌃⌘I), Deselect Folders, and Select by Extension… (⌃⌘E) — type a list like "jpg, mp4" and select only those, add them, or deselect them; the list is remembered. Works in list and icon views and in search and smart folder results (not yet in column view)</li>
<li>Copy and Cut now work in search and smart folder results, so files found in many subfolders can be collected in one go</li>
<li>With two or more panes, search results stay in the pane where you searched, and Paste works in a pane you just clicked (also an empty folder)</li>
<li>Search results in a narrow pane keep the file names visible (the location moves under the name)</li>
<li>Select All, Copy and Paste go to the search box or rename field while you are typing in it</li>
<li>The Edit menu was labelled "File"; clicking the Dock icon brings back a closed main window</li>
<li>Invert Selection, Deselect Folders and Select by Extension keep the list where it is instead of scrolling</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.17/Hayate-2.4.17.dmg" length="10144883" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7Wk+1s5l0aD6LGHEq0hQgDfXU9oVUi4TBkGHzk3/RrtXPrjSJ/y8GcPKrBsCzQaxs5pAN/jZtBdgjibyW0OVCA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.16</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:28:40 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>256</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Pause and resume copies, moves, duplicates and trashing: the pause button sits next to Cancel, and paused operations are listed with Resume and Cancel</li>
<li>While an operation is paused, waiting operations that do not touch the same files run in the meantime; ones that do wait and say what they are waiting for</li>
<li>Run Now: start a waiting operation right away — the running one pauses and continues by itself as soon as it is done</li>
<li>Moves to another drive can now be paused too, and the original is only removed if it is still exactly what was copied (otherwise both are kept)</li>
<li>If files are changed by another app while an operation is paused, that item is skipped instead of producing a mixed copy</li>
<li>Quitting with operations in progress asks first, then cancels them and removes unfinished copies; leftovers from a crash are cleaned up at the next launch</li>
<li>Folder copies now keep the folder's Finder tags and dates</li>
<li>Fixed: labels and messages added since July showed as internal names (for example the new size units setting); the app now ships its current texts in every language</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.16/Hayate-2.4.16.dmg" length="10052395" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="57lqGI53WyQjvgysv2aFSSyNCBKAbEadR+8kA2ei4wVRyTtvOpqfbIoV99qzAxblGFgH5bpFW/wt273cwf2tDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.15</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:31:02 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>255</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>New option in Settings → Appearance: show sizes in KiB, MiB, GiB (1024-based, like `ls -lh`) instead of KB, MB, GB</li>
<li>ZIP: archives made by Hayate no longer include macOS metadata from inside folders (.DS_Store, __MACOSX, ._ files, .Spotlight-V100, .Trashes and similar), so they look clean on Windows and Linux. Items you select directly are still included</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.15/Hayate-2.4.15.dmg" length="9918317" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="yKsOqj7AbvnaHwBDs9W1lZA41Z9G8W0N2peo3lR61rT+x8Ajr02AXF1AlO4jTZa3Az8SBp6qD0N7e/b13hdoBw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.4.14</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:17:38 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>254</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.4.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>SFTP: uploading never overwrites a file on the server without asking; a dropped connection no longer leaves a half-written file on either side</li>
<li>SFTP: the window no longer freezes while a file is uploaded or downloaded</li>
<li>Folders that cannot be read (failing drive, lost network volume, no permission) show an error instead of looking empty, and a folder read only part-way is marked as incomplete</li>
<li>Cancel now waits until the running copy or move has really stopped before the next one starts; a cancelled move never removes its source</li>
<li>Undo / Redo: if some files cannot be undone, the rest still are, and the failed ones stay in the history to try again</li>
<li>ZIP: damaged archives with impossible sizes no longer crash Hayate or fill the disk, and extracting never writes through a link that is already in the destination folder</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/revivals47/hayate-app/releases/download/v2.4.14/Hayate-2.4.14.dmg" length="9914299" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7jG8VPS7K9rc06b/lG0nZvBCdhEcra8v3ZF4odzKEQB9tNxJwwGsTWR2bZDIGZdfCZ9IHONthdOpn527SiElAw=="/>
        </item>
